{"articleNo":"81510","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=81510&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"예방접종 의료서비스 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.04.12","hit":"4291","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">우리대학교 구성원의 질병예방 및 자기 건강관리 능력 향상을 위하여 </span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">다음과 같이 예방접종 의료서비스를 안내하오니 이용에 참고하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1. 대상 : 학생 및 교직원</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2. 시행일자 : 2013. 4. 15(월) ~ 12. 31(화)</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">3. 접종기관 : 장쾌한 연합내과(옥계)[학생증 및 직원증 지참]</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">4. 접종내용 : A형간염, 독감, 파상풍 및 백일해, 자궁경부암, 폐구균, 대상포진</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">5. 비용 및 할인혜택&nbsp; 문의 : 의무실(학생회관 103호, Tel: 478-7119 )</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2013. 4. 12.</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;